5
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,000
San, dear.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
You do eat more than just lunch, don't you?

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Yes.

8
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Well, you always look so sickly. It concerns me.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Don't worry, honey. I'll bring you some nori the next chance I get.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Saga's nori is so nutritious.

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Thank you. I appreciate it.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Good morning to all of you.

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Morning, sir.

14
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Ah, look at that. Imari Bay sparkling today. Horseshoe crabs looking lively.

15
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I want you ladies to cook, slice and dry with the kind of pride that the best and only dried squid maker in Kyushu ought to have.

16
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Time for the company song. Let's see. Today our leader is you. Get up here, Tatsumi.

17
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Right.

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Good morning.

19
